    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "Classroom rules\n1. Examinations: Students must attend all of the examinations and presentation.\n2. Special reports: Please submit and assign oral reports on time. Failure to do so may result in fraud.\n3. We hope that students can attend on time. If you are unable to attend class, please remember to ask for leave in advance.\n課堂規則\n一、考試：學生一定要出席各種考試。\n二、專題報告: 請務必準時繳交及分配口頭報告，如果沒有繳交可能會被當。\n三、希望同學們能準時出席，如果無法上課時請記得提前請假。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1. Students are expected to attend the entire course of this semester and participate in discussions.<br />\n2. Students must participate in all exams and submit all assignments on time.<br />\n3. In addition, students need to prepare for this semester&rsquo;s exams and reports based on their own abilities.</div>\n\n<div>1. 期望同學能全程出席本學期課程，且參加討論問題。<br />\n2. 同學必須要參與所有考試以及準時繳交各項作業。<br />\n3. 另外同學們需要以自己的實力準備本學期的考試以及報告。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
